WEBVTT

00:00.270 --> 00:03.850
<b>Episode 4: Legend with Him</b>

00:10.440 --> 00:12.090
<i>Looks: A+!</i>

00:10.870 --> 00:12.570
<b>Looks A+</b>

00:13.860 --> 00:15.590
<i>Body: A+!</i>

00:14.120 --> 00:15.580
<b>Body A+</b>

00:17.750 --> 00:19.850
<i>Personality: A+!</i>

00:18.620 --> 00:19.840
<b>Personality A+
(On the outside)</b>

00:20.550 --> 00:24.350
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen years old. 
Osaka born and bred.</i>

00:24.620 --> 00:27.660
<i>A girl who charms as easily as she breathes.</i>

00:28.110 --> 00:29.590
<i>It's been a year since I moved to Tokyo.</i>

00:34.340 --> 00:37.640
<i>And in my high school life, 
it's me for the win!</i>

01:05.460 --> 01:05.880
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

01:05.460 --> 01:05.880
<b>Medaka!</b>

01:06.130 --> 01:06.880
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

01:06.130 --> 01:06.880
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

01:06.130 --> 01:06.880
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

01:06.130 --> 01:06.880
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

02:02.310 --> 02:08.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:02.310 --> 02:08.990
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:09.730 --> 02:13.900
Our school has a really lovely legend 
related to the school festival.

02:14.440 --> 02:18.190
If you hold hands with your crush there 
during the school festival,

02:18.190 --> 02:20.990
the two of you will be bound forever in love!

02:20.990 --> 02:24.740
It kicks off a bunch of 
relationships every year.

02:29.590 --> 02:34.080
<i>The passageway of destiny, 
AKA the Bridge of Love!</i>

02:39.720 --> 02:42.390
<i>Wow, they're actually doin' it.</i>

02:42.680 --> 02:44.570
Huh? Mona-chan?

02:44.570 --> 02:46.390
Who's that with her?

02:46.640 --> 02:49.440
But if they're here now, that must mean...

02:49.440 --> 02:50.720
They're dating?

02:51.650 --> 02:56.610
<b>Bunny</b>

02:56.610 --> 02:58.920
<i>Yikes, this is bad news.</i>

02:58.920 --> 03:01.740
<i>So you really do like Kuroiwa-kun!</i>

03:01.740 --> 03:05.370
<i>I'm gonna end up mass-producing Haruno-san!</i>

03:05.370 --> 03:08.700
Hey, uh, we should probably head back to class.

03:08.700 --> 03:10.000
<i>What now?</i>

03:10.000 --> 03:11.250
<i>Oh, I know!</i>

03:11.250 --> 03:16.500
Kuroiwa-kun, if we promote our cafe here, 
these couples might come.

03:17.590 --> 03:20.670
We're running a bunny cafe on the 4th floor!

03:17.630 --> 03:27.140
<b>Bunny</b>

03:20.670 --> 03:23.260
If you came by, I'd be really hoppy!

03:23.260 --> 03:24.180
Your turn.

03:24.180 --> 03:27.140
P-Please hop by.

03:27.390 --> 03:28.890
Oh, that's it?

03:28.890 --> 03:31.140
They're just here to promote? Okay, we'll go!

03:31.980 --> 03:33.400
<i>Close call.</i>

03:33.930 --> 03:37.070
<i>Wait, isn't this actually a great chance?</i>

03:40.070 --> 03:41.990
Say, Kuroiwa-kun.

03:43.070 --> 03:47.200
Did you know that this passageway 
is called the Bridge of Love?

03:48.370 --> 03:51.660
Any couple that holds hands here 
during the school festival

03:51.660 --> 03:53.960
will be bound forever in love, apparently.

03:54.630 --> 03:56.670
H-Huh...

03:59.260 --> 04:01.010
Oh, sorry about that.

04:01.420 --> 04:03.180
Did I make your heart skip a beat?

04:03.180 --> 04:04.050
Wha...

04:05.390 --> 04:07.300
<i>What a dangerous legend.</i>

04:07.790 --> 04:08.890
I'm heading back.

04:11.390 --> 04:12.480
Eek!

04:15.270 --> 04:17.020
<i>Things are goin' great!</i>

04:17.020 --> 04:18.570
Owie...

04:20.480 --> 04:22.780
<i>I clearly have his attention.</i>

04:23.490 --> 04:25.490
Sorry, Kuroiwa-kun.

04:25.490 --> 04:29.450
Could you help me up here?

04:30.660 --> 04:35.000
<i>Boom. This'll lead to us holding hands,</i>

04:35.540 --> 04:38.420
<i>and I'll be livin' in his head rent-free!</i>

04:41.170 --> 04:45.010
<i>No guy can ignore me in this scenario.</i>

04:45.400 --> 04:48.350
<i>It's a comeback, walk-off home run!</i>

04:52.520 --> 04:54.310
<i>Now, hurry up</i>

04:54.850 --> 04:56.350
<i>and take my hand—</i>

04:59.480 --> 05:00.360
Huh?

05:03.070 --> 05:03.860
I...

05:08.660 --> 05:10.030
I'm heading back.

05:21.000 --> 05:22.000
<i>Wh...</i>

05:23.920 --> 05:26.930
<i>Why'd he go for my pits?!</i>

05:32.260 --> 05:34.980
<i>One hour until the festival ends.</i>

05:34.980 --> 05:36.850
<i>I'm not out of it yet!</i>

05:36.850 --> 05:39.150
<i>He can't have gotten very far.</i>

05:39.440 --> 05:43.150
<i>I ain't givin' up cause it didn't work once. 
I'm takin' him back there again!</i>

05:43.780 --> 05:44.740
<i>There he is!</i>

05:47.650 --> 05:49.490
Kuroiwa-kun!

05:50.660 --> 05:54.830
Don't just walk off without me. 
It's too early to go back to work.

05:55.540 --> 05:57.290
Oh, there they are.

05:57.290 --> 05:59.420
Hey, you two.

05:59.420 --> 06:02.860
Sorry, but can you come back 
to work right away?

06:02.860 --> 06:07.090
We've got so many couples 
walking in at the last minute.

06:07.090 --> 06:09.390
We can't handle the crowd ourselves.

06:09.740 --> 06:11.890
Huh? But I...

06:11.890 --> 06:13.640
Pretty please!

06:17.240 --> 06:23.770
<i>The school festival is now closed. 
Thank you for visiting us today.</i>

06:36.290 --> 06:40.790
<i>No way... I failed again. This sucks.</i>

06:41.060 --> 06:42.840
Good work, everyone.

06:42.840 --> 06:45.340
Thank you so much too, Mona-chan.

06:45.710 --> 06:47.010
Sure...

06:51.470 --> 06:52.850
<i>Darn it.</i>

06:53.320 --> 06:56.220
<i>I'm done for the day. 
Time to go home and cry myself to sleep!</i>

06:56.220 --> 06:58.980
<i>D-Did things not work out?</i>

07:01.100 --> 07:03.520
Oh, K-Kuroiwa-kun!

07:03.520 --> 07:06.400
Could you help Mona-chan carry the desks back?

07:07.480 --> 07:09.700
B-By order of the committee!

07:09.700 --> 07:10.570
Urk.

07:10.570 --> 07:11.450
Oho?

07:11.450 --> 07:14.240
Never heard Haruno-san be so assertive before.

07:14.240 --> 07:16.330
A rare sight.

07:16.330 --> 07:17.790
Wait...

07:18.200 --> 07:19.580
It's okay.

07:19.580 --> 07:21.790
You can do this, Mona-chan.

07:33.550 --> 07:37.260
Uh, you should probably 
watch where we're going.

07:37.260 --> 07:39.060
The sun's getting in my eyes.

07:39.340 --> 07:43.560
Lead the way, please? 
I'll watch our feet for us.

07:43.880 --> 07:48.820
<i>Yeah, right. I just don't have the energy 
to hold my head up and smile.</i>

07:52.400 --> 07:54.140
<i>Are we headed toward...</i>

07:58.080 --> 08:00.330
<i>Eh, it'll be fine.</i>

08:04.370 --> 08:08.590
<i>Cripes, this silence is killing me.</i>

08:08.590 --> 08:13.090
H-Hey, did you at least have some fun today?

08:18.600 --> 08:21.270
<i>What am I even askin' him?</i>

08:21.270 --> 08:25.020
<i>There's no way he had fun. 
I messed everything up.</i>

08:25.020 --> 08:27.360
<i>Not one thing went right today.</i>

08:35.410 --> 08:38.240
<i>If only that last ploy had worked...</i>

08:48.960 --> 08:50.130
Mona-chan.

08:56.450 --> 08:59.390
<i>H-Huh? Isn't this...</i>

09:01.180 --> 09:03.350
<i>the Bridge of Love?!</i>

09:13.820 --> 09:16.860
Th-That doesn't count! 
The school festival's already over!

09:16.860 --> 09:18.160
So, you know...

09:18.460 --> 09:20.530
I-It is, huh?

09:20.530 --> 09:23.790
<i>That's right. What am I blushin' for?</i>

09:24.500 --> 09:27.790
<i>Gah, what is wrong with me?</i>

09:28.080 --> 09:30.630
But... I did have fun.

09:31.170 --> 09:31.880
Huh?

09:32.590 --> 09:38.640
I... I'd never experienced 
anything like it before.

09:44.470 --> 09:47.310
<i>He really knows how to get on my nerves.</i>

09:51.520 --> 09:53.230
<b>Pic from our school festival</b>

09:51.790 --> 09:53.650
<i>Check it out! Ain't I cute?</i>

09:53.650 --> 09:56.240
<i>Yeah, yeah, very cute.</i>

10:03.910 --> 10:07.500
Uh... Did we get a bunch of new couples?

10:07.500 --> 10:10.790
So the legend was true.

10:10.790 --> 10:12.000
Right?

10:12.320 --> 10:15.260
<i>I'm amazed they can believe 
in that "Bridge of Love" crap.</i>

10:18.590 --> 10:23.060
Um, how'd it go with you yesterday? 
At the passageway...

10:23.060 --> 10:26.520
Man, such fine weather today!

10:26.770 --> 10:28.140
Mona-chan?

10:28.940 --> 10:30.600
Oh, Kuroiwa-kun.

10:37.190 --> 10:38.900
<b>ba-dump</b>

10:46.160 --> 10:48.840
<i>Wh-Why'd I hide just now?</i>

10:48.840 --> 10:51.380
<i>My body cowered when I saw his face!</i>

10:52.120 --> 10:55.630
<i>I know I left a mark yesterday. 
Gotta keep my foot on the gas.</i>

10:56.090 --> 10:58.130
M-Mornin'!

10:59.350 --> 11:00.410
...ning.

11:00.410 --> 11:02.640
Morning, Mona-chan.

11:02.920 --> 11:04.850
<i>Play it cool.</i>

11:04.850 --> 11:06.970
Let's walk to class together.

11:06.970 --> 11:08.640
Sounds good.

11:09.260 --> 11:12.770
Say, why don't we all go bowling after school?

11:13.560 --> 11:16.400
Festival wrap party. 
You should come too, Haruno-san.

11:16.680 --> 11:20.280
Huh... If Mona-chan's going, maybe I will too.

11:20.280 --> 11:21.660
Sounds good.

11:21.950 --> 11:22.910
"We all"?

11:24.140 --> 11:26.080
<i>Including Medaka?!</i>

11:26.740 --> 11:28.250
<i>Great chance!</i>

11:32.360 --> 11:33.840
Whoo!

11:33.840 --> 11:36.000
Nice strike, Mona-chan!

11:36.000 --> 11:36.960
Yay!

11:37.920 --> 11:40.970
<i>I know I'm just one step away.</i>

11:40.970 --> 11:42.970
<i>I'm gonna seal the deal here!</i>

11:44.470 --> 11:45.720
Yay.

11:45.720 --> 11:46.680
Yay.

11:46.680 --> 11:47.680
Yay.

11:47.680 --> 11:48.970
Yay.

11:48.970 --> 11:52.310
Huh? Not joining in, Kuroiwa-kun?

11:52.730 --> 11:54.350
<i>A high-five to poke at him.</i>

11:54.350 --> 11:57.940
<i>Should be effective on anyone 
who likes group vibes.</i>

12:13.750 --> 12:17.840
M-My laces snapped. 
I'll go get some fresh ones.

12:18.650 --> 12:22.800
<i>Why'd that memory come back? 
Buzz off, please!</i>

12:22.800 --> 12:24.930
Don't run! You'll trip!

12:25.760 --> 12:29.010
<i>I dunno if today's gonna work out either!</i>

12:31.560 --> 12:34.020
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

12:36.640 --> 12:39.020
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

12:44.980 --> 12:46.570
Aw!

12:46.570 --> 12:49.260
It's okay. It's love-all right now.

12:49.260 --> 12:53.110
Dude, that's a tennis score. 
You're not helping.

12:55.260 --> 12:57.130
I can't fit my fingers in.

12:56.180 --> 12:57.130
Don't worry about it.

13:02.920 --> 13:05.680
<i>Man, that freaked me out.</i>

13:06.130 --> 13:11.100
Try standing a little to the right. 
That should help.

13:06.590 --> 13:11.680
<i>I've never high-fived a girl. 
Is this what city life is like?</i>

13:12.310 --> 13:16.770
<i>I-I could've high-fived her 
if her laces hadn't snapped.</i>

13:16.770 --> 13:20.690
<i>Wait, no! Clear mind, clear spirit, remember?</i>

13:21.190 --> 13:25.150
<i>I transferred to a co-ed 
school to train my mind.</i>

13:25.150 --> 13:27.200
<i>But look at me lately...</i>

13:32.540 --> 13:34.910
<i>Th-This is a disaster!</i>

13:35.410 --> 13:39.420
<i>I could've sat next to him when I got back,</i>

13:39.420 --> 13:42.420
<i>but instead I ended up sitting 
all the way over here!</i>

13:53.560 --> 13:57.310
<i>Acting like this is a disgrace!</i>

13:58.230 --> 13:59.560
May I sit next to you?

14:01.360 --> 14:02.610
You don't mind?

14:03.440 --> 14:05.110
Wow, I'm so lucky!

14:09.030 --> 14:09.780
Like this.

14:10.850 --> 14:12.200
L-Like this?

14:12.200 --> 14:16.000
Yeah, let the weight of the ball 
give your arm momentum.

14:16.410 --> 14:19.080
Whatcha drinking? Cola?

14:19.830 --> 14:23.300
Y'know, I'm actually feeling kinda thirsty.

14:24.830 --> 14:27.630
Can I have a sip? No?

14:28.530 --> 14:30.640
I put my lips to that already.

14:31.180 --> 14:33.180
<i>Y-You can do it, Mona!</i>

14:34.350 --> 14:38.850
<i>This is nothing! Just don't think about it!</i>

14:42.060 --> 14:44.360
<i>Now to seal the deal.</i>

14:45.530 --> 14:48.860
<i>Who the hell do you think I am?</i>

14:50.070 --> 14:51.200
Wait...

15:00.420 --> 15:02.460
<i>I'm Mona Kawai!</i>

15:07.010 --> 15:08.670
I-I did it!

15:09.050 --> 15:11.430
Nice strike, Haruno-san!

15:14.600 --> 15:16.720
That hits the spot!

15:17.150 --> 15:19.940
Oh, but that's an indirect kiss, huh?

15:20.980 --> 15:22.200
You can have it back now.

15:22.650 --> 15:24.520
<i>See that, Medaka?</i>

15:25.190 --> 15:28.150
<i>Training... This is training!</i>

15:28.440 --> 15:31.490
<i>I'm back on my game now!</i>

15:32.110 --> 15:34.990
<i>That musta got your heart racing!</i>

15:38.620 --> 15:39.660
Actually, I'm good.

15:42.000 --> 15:46.500
Y-You can have the rest. Oh, my turn.

15:46.880 --> 15:48.670
Wh... Wh...

15:48.670 --> 15:51.970
<b>B{*\c&H8F6BCD&}o{*\c&H8466C8&}w{*\c&H7A60C3&}l{*\c&H705ABE&}i{*\c&H6555B9&}ng</b>

15:49.050 --> 15:51.050
<i>Why the heck?!</i>

15:52.680 --> 15:55.300
I... I survived.

15:56.100 --> 15:58.890
<i>Gah, he pisses me off!</i>

16:06.820 --> 16:07.610
Oops.

16:13.950 --> 16:16.450
Ta-dah! Winter sweater!

16:16.450 --> 16:19.330
Mona-chan looks great 
in the winter uniform, too!

16:19.330 --> 16:21.960
Cute! So cute!

16:24.920 --> 16:27.840
You're not switching yet, Kuroiwa-kun?

16:27.840 --> 16:31.210
Our school sweater is very popular. 
It has a bunch of color variations.

16:31.920 --> 16:34.340
You know how your fingertips 
get cold in the winter?

16:34.630 --> 16:37.180
You can warm them up by hiding them this way.

16:38.430 --> 16:40.350
Moe sleeves are goated!

16:42.350 --> 16:44.780
I can handle the cold just fine.

16:46.060 --> 16:48.150
<i>Darn it.</i>

16:48.150 --> 16:51.650
By the way, Mona-chan, I get hot easily.

16:55.530 --> 16:58.660
<i>He's as tough a nut to crack as ever!</i>

17:02.410 --> 17:03.330
Tch.

17:11.420 --> 17:13.920
<b>Sho,</b>

17:11.420 --> 17:13.920
<b>Today</b>

17:11.420 --> 17:13.920
<b>Meet us behind
school building rn</b>

17:17.330 --> 17:20.560
Medaka, you punk, you ever 
heard of being friendly?

17:21.180 --> 17:22.560
Uhm...?

17:22.970 --> 17:26.560
How long are you gonna keep 
treating Mona-chan like crap?

17:26.940 --> 17:29.360
I have tenets to follow.

17:29.360 --> 17:31.070
Tenets, schmenets!

17:31.070 --> 17:31.900
Wha...

17:31.900 --> 17:34.940
You wanna say your religion 
forbids romance, right?

17:34.940 --> 17:39.320
Doesn't that just mean all you 
gotta do is not fall for her?

17:39.950 --> 17:41.790
Fall for her? I'm not...

17:42.340 --> 17:44.620
Sounds like a you problem to me.

17:45.060 --> 17:50.130
Do you have any idea how Mona-chan looks 
every time you treat her that way?

17:53.050 --> 17:55.050
She looks really sad.

17:55.050 --> 18:00.010
And she still keeps talking to you. 
Don't you get how saintly that is?!

18:00.970 --> 18:03.560
You heartless little turd.

18:03.930 --> 18:05.140
Turd...

18:05.730 --> 18:07.940
You tell him too, Yuzuru!

18:07.940 --> 18:10.230
Huh? Why me?

18:10.610 --> 18:13.190
I'd prefer to keep 
the rival count down, though.

18:13.770 --> 18:16.990
Oh, well. It's worth it 
to make Mona-chan smile.

18:17.740 --> 18:23.490
Listen, does simply talking to girls 
break your tenets or whatever?

18:23.490 --> 18:28.120
N-No. That much is fine.

18:28.120 --> 18:29.750
Huh. Okay, so...

18:30.160 --> 18:33.130
Do your teachings not include 
being nice to people?

18:35.510 --> 18:39.730
Mona-chan's been looking out for you 
ever since you transferred in, y'know?

18:39.730 --> 18:41.830
Try repaying—

18:41.830 --> 18:44.890
Oh, that's all from me.

18:44.890 --> 18:46.810
Finish what you're saying, dude.

18:47.130 --> 18:49.350
I don't want any more rivals, man.

18:57.610 --> 18:59.670
K-Kuroiwa-kun.

19:01.110 --> 19:03.910
I-I want to ask you something.

19:04.780 --> 19:06.160
Haruno-san?

19:07.250 --> 19:10.250
Why are you always so cold to Mona-chan?!

19:11.250 --> 19:13.600
H-Hey, calm down a little.

19:13.600 --> 19:16.050
Even I've had it up to here!

19:16.050 --> 19:17.170
<i>Even</i> you?

19:17.170 --> 19:21.220
She does so much for you, it's no fair—
I mean, it's no way to act!

19:23.090 --> 19:25.370
Are they breaking up? 
I didn't know they were dating.

19:26.680 --> 19:30.980
Y-You're the one who's coldest to her!

19:30.980 --> 19:31.560
Hmph!

19:33.190 --> 19:35.650
Th-The coldest?

19:36.480 --> 19:41.440
<i>But she's the one messing me up the most.</i>

19:42.320 --> 19:44.350
Where are you going, Sensei?

19:45.240 --> 19:47.240
Oh, just carrying these.

19:47.240 --> 19:49.570
I'll help. Staff room?

19:49.570 --> 19:50.250
Yeah.

19:52.330 --> 19:53.390
Thanks.

19:55.750 --> 19:58.520
<i>She's a nice girl. I know that.</i>

19:59.560 --> 20:03.010
Doesn't that just mean all you 
gotta do is not fall for her?

20:03.360 --> 20:06.230
Do your teachings not include 
being nice to people?

20:10.770 --> 20:13.650
Huh? Where's my textbook?

20:14.930 --> 20:17.900
Gah, class is about to start.

20:20.820 --> 20:23.360
<i>I must've forgotten it at home.</i>

20:24.530 --> 20:25.370
Hey.

20:26.820 --> 20:29.950
W-Want to share mine?

20:31.960 --> 20:35.330
Really? Lemme shift my desk over!

20:42.470 --> 20:46.090
<i>C-Crap! Why did I do that?</i>

20:48.600 --> 20:50.770
<i>Medaka, you jerk!</i>

20:49.850 --> 20:51.430
<i>Be nice to her, damn it!</i>

20:56.480 --> 21:01.360
<i>I-It's not like I </i>want<i> to be mean to her.</i>

21:02.620 --> 21:06.360
<i>I messed up. I ruined a good chance.</i>

21:06.700 --> 21:09.620
<i>Medaka approached me for once, too!</i>

21:09.620 --> 21:12.620
<i>I'm so stupid! Stupid!</i>

21:20.500 --> 21:25.600
I-I just got a bit startled 
because it was all so sudden.

21:31.510 --> 21:34.030
Y-You don't have to if you don't want to.

21:34.030 --> 21:35.980
Oh, wait! Wait!

21:36.890 --> 21:39.480
I do want to! Let's share! We gotta!

21:40.110 --> 21:41.230
Thanks!

21:43.070 --> 21:44.900
S-Sure.

